OL,3,GNEWSAHeroes championed at BBC Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old girl who created a
OL,7,Fkindness campaign after being bullied
OL,8,Fwas among the winners at an award
OL,9,Fceremony celebrating local heroes.
OL,11,FThe BBC Radio Oxford Make a Difference
OL,12,FAwards had eight categories,
OL,13,Frecognising those who love to make life
OL,14,Fbetter for others in the county.
OL,16,FTo date, millions of people have been
OL,17,Finvolved in Make a Difference across
OL,18,FBBC radio stations.
